{"root":{"data":{"id":"2cb8d25c49a9","created":1740462602,"text":"main.cpp","priority":null,"progress":null,"note":"你"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"d81ajr2un3k0","created":1740462736391,"text":"init()"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"d81alrh85go0","created":1740462893987,"text":"readLefDef()","note":"访问不到"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"d81aoz7kxoo0","created":1740463145911,"text":"readGuide()","note":"类似GR的操作，存储至tmpGuides"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"d81aqmojnv40","created":1740463275367,"text":"postPross()","note":"添加约束，以及默认VIA"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"d81c6mrlgsw0","created":1740467350488,"text":"main()"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"d81c8tddbnk0","created":1740467521593,"text":"init()","note":"处理VIA（上下层，宽度）\n相关约束\nfiller cell.macro等unique单元\n处理pin"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"d81c8xpueg00","created":1740467531055,"text":"prep()","note":"prepPoint()生成代连接的点，点可能进行分类：比如处于track上，track中心上等\n\nrevertaccesspoint()根据单元的方向处理point\n\npreppattern()大致在处理accesspoint()，满足drc要求"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"d81ekfpmq1c0","created":1740474074450,"text":"postprossguide()","note":"A*的GR，更新参数","priority":1},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"d81ajyrsh3c0","created":1740462753135,"text":"prep()","layout_mind_offset":{"x":14.249999981373549,"y":-6.250000279396659}},"children":[{"data":{"id":"d81zwdk56w00","created":1740534253442,"text":"init()","note":"没什么操作，初始化vector"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"d81zwo81c280","created":1740534276655,"text":"prep()","note":"生成violation:\n\n1:\nprep_viaForbiddenThrough\n可布线层的上下4个方向，依据：\nViaDef不存在或者存在第十层，via名称为CK_23_28_0_26_VH_CK\n\n2：\nprep_lineForbiddenLen\n可布线层的XY两个方向，考虑是否为Z型布线。依据：getminspacing()存在，对于三种约束没生成不同区间长度，\n输出合并区间\n\n3：prep_viaForbiddenPlanarLen\n没作用\n\n4：\nprep_viaForbiddenTurnLen（）\n类似1+2生成forbidden区间但是是6个方向\n\n5：\nprep_via2viaForbidden（）\n8种组合：上下层via+布线方向\n约束处理：金属层的最小间距约束，处理最小切割数规则，处理同一或不同切割层的间距规则，GF14工艺的LEF58凹角间距规则。\n最终形成合并后的forbidden区间以及overlap区间，overlap可能与cost相关，也可能只是换名\n"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"d81ajwge0nk0","created":1740462748092,"text":"ta()","layout_mind_offset":{"x":419.2500037066639,"y":623.9999964237215}},"children":[{"data":{"id":"d821j4np6io0","created":1740538857552,"text":"initta（）","note":"只针对bottom layer的的TA，且只进行一次\n\n","layout_right_offset":{"x":330.99999560415756,"y":153.74999994412065}},"children":[{"data":{"id":"d821k59bth40","created":1740538937224,"text":"init_ta_helper()","layout_right_offset":{"x":310.2499964050949,"y":92.74999986961484},"note":"函数大致返回一个连接状况\n分普通版和GPU版，GPU版支持8线程，在每50个gcell分线程初始化\n\ngetGCellPatterns。0：x方向数量，1：y方向数量\n\nroute_box：50*50gcells\next_box：51*51gcells(+-0.5)\n\n相关data存储在worker中"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"d821w68vsqg0","created":1740539879744,"text":"main()","layout_right_offset":{"x":324.9999951571226,"y":8.749999869614726}},"children":[{"data":{"id":"d821whkis7c0","created":1740539904392,"text":"init()","layout_right_offset":{"x":204.99999694526207,"y":-73.74999890103936}},"children":[{"data":{"id":"d8234hxfo9k0","created":1740543353196,"text":"rp.init()","layout_right_offset":{"x":246,"y":-84},"note":"初始化，相关参数即init"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"d8235l6jsso0","created":1740543438642,"text":"initTracks()","layout_right_offset":{"x":268,"y":-64},"note":"根据def文件生成相应的track的坐标。\n存储在trackLocs"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"d8235lu4ykg0","created":1740543440068,"text":"initFixedObjs()","layout_right_offset":{"x":296,"y":-48},"note":"标记布线轨道的障碍物：\nterm(引脚) pathseg、via（过孔或其周边）特殊工艺处理、障碍物。主要是在track上添加cost"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"d824cvunsw80","created":1740546831527,"text":"initIroutes()","layout_right_offset":{"x":259,"y":-17},"note":"便利所有的guide\n对于每一个guide：\n\ninitIroute_helper_pin()\n针对pin生成起始点和终点的坐标存储在downviacoordset和upviacoordset中。\n判断依据：\nlayerNum == bNum && getRouteBox().contains(apBp)\n\n但是如果失败的话即pin生成失败则执行函数：\ninitIroute_helper_generic（）\n扩大guide范围至guide周围，确定起始点和终点，其中wlen表示选择从起始点还是从终点连接的优先级，正数则从中点。\n另外wlen2确定连线的位置，连接点不在bin中，则wlen2为0表随机\n\n最后将生成的起始点和终点坐标，以及track。存储到iroute中，"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"d824cyncrs80","created":1740546837615,"text":"initcost()","layout_right_offset":{"x":264,"y":-8}},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"d826dxh7t940","created":1740552555651,"text":"sortiroutes()","layout_right_offset":{"x":267,"y":9},"note":"    bool operator<(const taPin &b) const {\n      if (this->cost != b.cost) {\n        return this->getCost() > b.getCost();\n      } else {\n        return this->getId() < b.getId();\n      }\n    }\n排序"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"d821wm1gh7k0","created":1740539914123,"text":"end()","layout_right_offset":{"x":203.2499968521297,"y":154.74999875202775}},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"d821wmej6740","created":1740539914914,"text":"assign()","layout_right_offset":{"x":221.2499967031182,"y":-72.49999891966581},"note":"pinassign存在最大次数"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"d826sbby5740","created":1740553682906,"text":"assignIroute_init","layout_right_offset":{"x":233,"y":-33}},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"d826snuly1s0","created":1740553710156,"text":"assignIroute_availTracks","layout_right_offset":{"x":332,"y":-25},"note":"形成区间"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"d826smuqfow0","created":1740553707986,"text":"assignIroute_updateIroute","layout_right_offset":{"x":363,"y":34},"note":"主要在更新iroute集以及相关参数","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"d826tdq1xnk0","created":1740553766477,"text":"assignIroute_bestTrack","layout_right_offset":{"x":202,"y":-76},"note":"二分法"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"d826sm2qw8w0","created":1740553706294,"text":"assignIroute_updateOthers","layout_right_offset":{"x":338,"y":49}},"children":[]}]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"d826wvigya00","created":1740554040293,"text":"searchrepair()","layout_right_offset":{"x":320,"y":-30},"note":"重复执行一次上述操作"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"d81akap6csg0","created":1740462779099,"text":"dr()"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"d82702uzmz40","created":1740554291380,"text":"searchrepair()","layout_left_offset":{"x":-205,"y":149},"note":"分线程处理bin中的dr\n\nbatchsize 2*2\nmax thread :8\n"},"children":[{"data":{"id"